---
// src/components/ReputationFeature.astro
---

<section id="case-studies" class="relative bg-[#0a0c09] text-white py-28 sm:py-36 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Image with Scrim -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/images/Case image.webp"
      alt="Partner reflecting at window in nighttime executive office"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-right opacity-65 mix-blend-luminosity filter brightness-95"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0a0c09] via-[#0a0c09]/85 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0c09]/70 via-transparent to-[#0a0c09]/40"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14">
    <!-- Eyebrow & Hairline Divider -->
    <div class="reveal-on-scroll">
      <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70 font-medium">
        FEATURED CASE STUDY
      </p>
      <div class="w-full border-t border-white/20 mt-4 mb-12 sm:mb-16"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2 Column Content Split -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
      <!-- Left Column: Title -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem] font-normal leading-[1.1] text-white tracking-tight max-w-lg">
          When Reputation is on the Line
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Paragraph + Button -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-[13.5px] text-white/80 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          When a matter carries commercial, regulatory and reputational risk all at once, the right advice depends on judgement as much as legal skill — knowing when to fight, and when a resolution serves the client best.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-black text-xs font-normal px-5 py-3 rounded-none hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            <span>Learn More</span>
            <span class="text-sm">&#8599;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>